[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9302.87, "timestamp": "02:35:02", "text": "あそこじゃないよ。 まるで、実際に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9304.71, "timestamp": "02:35:04", "text": "ping pingできないような感じです。ええ、あれは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9306.389, "timestamp": "02:35:06", "text": "pingできません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9308.469, "timestamp": "02:35:08", "text": "私の側で何かがそれをブロックしているからです。 しかし、そこには"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9312.15, "timestamp": "02:35:12", "text": "小さな穴がある。 もう少しで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9314.389, "timestamp": "02:35:14", "text": "通り抜けられそうだが、完全には"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9317.349, "timestamp": "02:35:17", "text": "無理だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9319.83, "timestamp": "02:35:19", "text": "さて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9322.79, "timestamp": "02:35:22", "text": "この呪文の面白いところは、技術的には"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9327.19, "timestamp": "02:35:27", "text": "10フィート以内であれば、クリスピンを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9328.389, "timestamp": "02:35:28", "text": "中に召喚できるということです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9331.91, "timestamp": "02:35:31", "text": "確かに、あなたならできますよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9335.67, "timestamp": "02:35:35", "text": "。 もうどうでもいい。 よし。   よし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9338.309, "timestamp": "02:35:38", "text": "。 えっと、もう一度何の電話ですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9341.67, "timestamp": "02:35:41", "text": "？ ここでは見えない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9345.27, "timestamp": "02:35:45", "text": "デスランはありますか？ さあ行こう。 くそ。   一体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9346.469, "timestamp": "02:35:46", "text": "どういうことだ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9348.95, "timestamp": "02:35:48", "text": "あそこにクリステンがいます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9351.19, "timestamp": "02:35:51", "text": "まるで「ところで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9353.11, "timestamp": "02:35:53", "text": "クリスエンを透明にしよう」って感じですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9354.63, "timestamp": "02:35:54", "text": "おっと、それは見えないわけじゃない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9356.87, "timestamp": "02:35:56", 